---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms governing your use of Honest Picture — an educational, informational research tool that does not provide professional advice."
  path="/terms"
  eyebrow="Trust & Legal"
  heading="Terms of Use"
  lede="Plain terms for using an educational website. By using Honest Picture, you agree to these."
  updated="June 2026"
>
  <h2>What Honest Picture is</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} ("we," "us") is an educational and informational website. It
    presents publicly available research and population data, and offers an
    interactive assessment that places your answers in that context. It is not a
    professional service.
  </p>

  <h2>No professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this site is medical, psychological, financial, legal, or other
    professional advice, and nothing here creates a professional relationship. The
    assessment does not diagnose, treat, or evaluate any condition. Always seek the
    advice of a qualified professional for decisions that matter, and never
    disregard or delay professional advice because of something you read here. See
    our full <a href="/disclaimer">disclaimer</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Use of the site</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You may read, share, and link to our pages freely.</li>
    <li>
      You may not scrape the site at scale, republish substantial portions of our
      content as your own, or use it in a way that misrepresents the source or the
      research.
    </li>
    <li>
      You may not use the site for any unlawful purpose or in any way that could
      damage, disable, or impair it.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The writing, design, and original presentation on this site are ours. The
    underlying research and statistics belong to their respective authors and
    institutions, whom we cite. Brief quotation with attribution is welcome; please
    link back to the source page.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy and "as is"</h2>
  <p>
    We work hard to be accurate and to cite real sources, but research evolves,
    figures are rounded, and errors are possible. The site is provided "as is,"
    without warranties of any kind. We make no guarantee that any information is
    complete, current, or applicable to your specific situation.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any decision you
    make, or any loss or harm you experience, in connection with your use of this
    site or reliance on its content. Your use of the site is at your own
    discretion and risk.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party links and advertising</h2>
  <p>
    We may link to third-party sources and, in the future, display advertising. We
    are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of third-party
    sites or advertisers.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms over time. Continued use of the site after changes
    means you accept the updated terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms? Email
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
